#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B1F/scripts.inc:29
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B1F_Text_SamuelIntro"
msgid ""
"The thought that I'm getting closer to\n"
"the POKéMON LEAGUE…\p"
"I'm getting stage fright…$"
msgstr ""
"一想到我离宝可梦联盟\n"
"越来越近了……\p"
"我就紧张得要命……$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B1F/scripts.inc:34
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B1F_Text_SamuelDefeat"
msgid "I couldn't do a thing…$"
msgstr "我什么都没能做到……$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B1F/scripts.inc:37
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B1F_Text_SamuelPostBattle"
msgid ""
"The POKéMON LEAGUE became distant\n"
"again… What a letdown…$"
msgstr ""
"宝可梦联盟又变得遥远了……\n"
"真让人失望……$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B1F/scripts.inc:41
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B1F_Text_ShannonIntro"
msgid ""
"To win your way through the POKéMON\n"
"LEAGUE, you need the trust of your\l"
"POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"想要在宝可梦联盟一路获胜，\n"
"就需要宝可梦的信任。$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B1F/scripts.inc:46
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B1F_Text_ShannonDefeat"
msgid ""
"Your relationship is based on\n"
"solid trust.$"
msgstr ""
"你们的关系\n"
"建立在坚实的信任之上。$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B1F/scripts.inc:50
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B1F_Text_ShannonPostBattle"
msgid ""
"By being together all the time, trust\n"
"grows between POKéMON and TRAINERS.$"
msgstr ""
"只要一直在一起，\n"
"宝可梦和训练家之间就会产生信任。$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B1F/scripts.inc:54
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B1F_Text_MichelleIntro"
msgid ""
"This isn't the goal. It's only a place\n"
"on the way to the POKéMON LEAGUE.$"
msgstr ""
"这里不是终点。只是通往\n"
"宝可梦联盟途中的一个地方。$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B1F/scripts.inc:58
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B1F_Text_MichelleDefeat"
msgid "That's the way!$"
msgstr "就是这样！$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B1F/scripts.inc:61
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B1F_Text_MichellePostBattle"
msgid ""
"You'll do fine, for sure!\n"
"Your POKéMON are all eager to go!$"
msgstr ""
"你一定没问题的！\n"
"你的宝可梦都干劲十足！$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B1F/scripts.inc:65
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B1F_Text_MitchellIntro"
msgid ""
"My POKéMON are cosmically\n"
"awe inspiring!$"
msgstr ""
"我的宝可梦\n"
"强大得惊天动地！$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B1F/scripts.inc:69
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B1F_Text_MitchellDefeat"
msgid "I've never met anyone like you before.$"
msgstr "我从没遇到过你这样的人。$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B1F/scripts.inc:72
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B1F_Text_MitchellPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Even outside of battle, I sense\n"
"incredible power emanating from you\l"
"and your POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"即使不在对战中，我也能感受到\n"
"你和你的宝可梦\l"
"散发出的惊人力量。$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B1F/scripts.inc:77
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B1F_Text_HalleIntro"
msgid ""
"Okay, no need to get your back up!\n"
"Relax, let's take it easy!$"
msgstr ""
"好啦，用不着这么紧张！\n"
"放轻松，我们慢慢来吧！$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B1F/scripts.inc:81
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B1F_Text_HalleDefeat"
msgid ""
"Whoa!\n"
"Wonderful!$"
msgstr ""
"哇！\n"
"太棒了！$"

#: data/maps/VictoryRoad_B1F/scripts.inc:85
msgctxt "VictoryRoad_B1F_Text_HallePostBattle"
msgid ""
"Sure, this is VICTORY ROAD.\p"
"But it's not all that different from\n"
"the path you've taken so far.\p"
"Try to enjoy things the rest of\n"
"the way!$"
msgstr ""
"没错，这里是冠军之路。\p"
"不过，这里和你至今走过的路\n"
"其实没什么不同。\p"
"剩下的路，\n"
"也试着好好享受吧！$"
